OL,3,GNEWSASevere delays on M25 after
OL,4,Amulti-vehicle crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FMotorists are facing severe delays on
OL,7,Fthe M25 in Surrey after a multi-vehicle
OL,8,Fcrash, according to traffic monitoring
OL,9,Fservice Inrix.
OL,11,FThe collision, involving three vans and
OL,12,Fa lorry, happened at about 06:55 GMT on
OL,13,FWednesday on the clockwise between
OL,14,Fjunction 11 at Chertsey and junction 12
OL,15,Fat Thorpe.
OL,17,FNational Highways said two lanes are
OL,18,Fclosed with delays in excess of 90
OL,19,Fminutes.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
